<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>back2able - ableton live project file downgrading utility</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css?v=<%= asset_version %>">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="content">
    <img src="/back2able.png" alt="back2able" class="logo">

    <p>Please upload an Ableton Live 12 file (.als) to convert it to Ableton Live 11.</p>

    <form id="convert-form" action="/convert" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
      <input id="file-input" type="file" name="file" accept=".als">
      <input id="submit-button" type="submit" value="Convert">
    </form>

    <div id="progress" class="progress" hidden>
      <div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="progress-text">Converting&hellip; <span id="elapsed">0</span>s</p>
      <p class="progress-hint">Large projects can take up to a minute.</p>
    </div>

    <p id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>

    <p>If the resulting file does not open in Live 11, please take a screencap of the error and send to odjpirkka@gmail.com.</p>
  </div>

  <script src="/app.js?v=<%= asset_version %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
